{"id":381,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"創意工夫で部活が伸びる桜丘の学び","feature_description":"桜丘中学・高等学校は「自立した個人の育成」を教育の目標とし、社会で活躍できる深い教養を育てる学校です。部活動への参加は自由で、約9割の生徒が活動し、兼部もできます。行事や学習でも創意工夫を重ね、限られた環境を生かして伸びる校風が特徴です。中学・高校のスクールライフ全体が、その姿勢を後押ししています。進路や学習の面でも、自分で考えて動く力を伸ばせます。","clubs":[{"id":7038,"name":"高校硬式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://sakuragaoka.ac.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7039,"name":"中学野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://sakuragaoka.ac.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7040,"name":"高校男子サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://sakuragaoka.ac.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7041,"name":"中学男子サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://sakuragaoka.ac.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7042,"name":"女子フットサル部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://sakuragaoka.ac.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7043,"name":"ゴルフ部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://sakuragaoka.ac.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7044,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://sakuragaoka.ac.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7045,"name":"バトントワリング部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://sakuragaoka.ac.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7046,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://sakuragaoka.ac.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7047,"name":"男子硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://sakuragaoka.ac.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7048,"name":"女子硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://sakuragaoka.ac.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7049,"name":"高校男子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://sakuragaoka.ac.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":7050,"name":"高校女子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","sou